⨯ keywords: `uint16` is a keyword and may not be used as an identifier
  @ test.idl:2:27

 2 │ typedef map<string, long> uint16;  // 'uint16' is a keyword
   │                           ˆˆˆˆˆˆ this is an IDL keyword

  ? the keyword can be escaped by changing to `_uint16`
  * keywords are matched case-insensitively against identifiers
